  "content": "\n\n<p><em>此模組於《Minecraft》中呈現了來自崩壞宇宙的「世界泡」，包含地形侵蝕機制、進度系統、全新武器與飾品、首領戰、修改後的玩家動畫以及重做的戰鬥機制。</em></p>\n<p><em>我的影片頻道：</em></p>\n<p><em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f3493286748621004%252flists%252f5739332%253ftype%253dseason\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://space.bilibili.com/3493286748621004/lists/5739332?type=season</a><br></em></p>\n<p><em>本mod展現了崩壞世界观下的mc世界泡。模組包含了地形侵蝕元素、升級系統、新的武器與飾品、boss戰、玩家動畫修改、戰鬥方式修改等。</em></p>\n<p><em>詳情可查看影片合集：<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fspace.bilibili.com%252f3493286748621004%252flists%252f5739332%253ftype%253dseason\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://space.bilibili.com/3493286748621004/lists/5739332?type=season</a><br></em></p>\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5f465156-b788-4d2b-b786-3e9f9d4194b3.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_062ff55f-c98b-4de6-8da3-5b1fb1e089ab.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_193ec12d-587e-4e8c-b610-575717e4be1b.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_5cb51670-0c47-470c-8f62-37601074f61a.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
